      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Commander and Defender</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;*Published initially under the title of "Supernova." That's now the title of the first chapter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Due to an unfortunate diplomatic incident, Catra has been away from Etheria for months and will be late to Scorpia's first ball. Once she does arrive, will she have enough self control to (temporarily) keep her hands off Adora? Or will she give in to the gnawing urge to reclaim what's hers before the party ends?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
